      "command": "build research_center at:15,5 tier:2",
      "description": "Left unmarked: cash is already at or below this building's cost at this point in the scenario, so the Build panel's buy button is disabled (BuildMenu.ts: `btn.disabled = cash < def.constructionCost || locked`) and a real player could not click it -- but the console `build` command has no funds guard and drives cash negative anyway (Finding #1's class, previously only confirmed for `vehicle buy`; this generalizes it to plain `build` too). Found by the interaction channel: command mode passes this step silently by overdrawing, something no click can do.",
      "interaction": [
        {
          "type": "command",
          "command": "build research_center at:15,5 tier:2"
        }
      ]
